riptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-xz","state":"uploaded","size":347330460,"digest":"sha256:7bedcb21e14ec79fe9f26c57a52e6f72acc27086c84c64edc0307b3d0a14447a","download_count":6612,"created_at":"2026-10-17T22:48:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T22:48:37Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/releases/download/cachyos-11.0-20261014-slr/proton-cachyos-11.0-20261014-slr-x86_64_v3.tar.xz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/tarball/cachyos-11.0-20261014-slr","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/zipball/cachyos-11.0-20261014-slr","body":"* Proton (SLR and Native)\n   - Updated to Proton Experimental [`11.0-20261014`](https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton/tree/experimental-11.0-20261014) with wine rebased on top of Bleeding Edge [`experimental-wine-bleeding-edge-11.0-453249-20261016-pf413b3-wc53678a-d6689ca-v0bb64c`](https://github.com/ValveSoftware/wine/tree/experimental-wine-bleeding-edge-11.0-453249-20261016-pf413b3-wc53678a-d6689ca-v0bb64c)\n   - Updated `winewayland.drv` to fix pointer constraints and a couple of other issues. Thanks to @BananaWorks07. Issues: https://github.com/CachyOS/wine-cachyos/issues/35\n   - Updated `winepipewire.drv` to fix various issues. The driver will now fall back to async mode instead of crashing if `rtkit` is missing from the system, although we recommend to install it. Thanks to @M0n7y5. PR: https://github.com/CachyOS/wine-cachyos/pull/36\n   - Fixed **Arknights: Endfield** not working after its latest update. Thanks to @NelloKudo. Issue: https://dawn.wine/dawn-winery/dwproton/issues/74\n   - Fixed some games like **Loop Hero** crashing when using WOW64. Thanks to @NelloKudo. Issue: https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/issues/308\n   - Backported the required changes from upstream Wine to fix **Warcraft III v3**. Thanks to @NelloKudo. Issue: https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/issues/292\n   - Thanks to the rebase on Bleeding Edge wine both issues with **Warhammer 40k: Spare Marine 2** have been resolved. Issues: https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/issues/305, https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/issues/302\n   - Updated `dxvk-sarek` to version [`v1.14.1`](https://github.com/pythonlover02/dxvk-sarek/releases/tag/v1.14.1). Thanks to @pythonlover02.\n   - Updated `protonfixes` to [`1.0.15-1867-ge89ce7b`](https://github.com/Open-Wine-Components/umu-protonfixes/commit/e89ce7b) and removed various stale and broken older fixes from it. Thanks to @BananaWorks07 for the janitorial work.\n   - Updated **OptiScaler** integration to also download **Streamline SDK** files when `PROTON_OPTISCALER_STREAMLINE=1` is set. This is not relevant right now but it will be in a future **OptiScaler** version. As far as I understand, this is not going to be compatible with every game, and thus it's left as a manual option.\n   - Logs generated by **Proton-CachyOS** now have the version of the tool used appented to the their filename.\n* Proton (SLR only)\n   - None\n* Proton (Native only)\n   - Added partial support for [32bit PhysX on AMD through ZLUDA](https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/issues/238), which can be enabled through `PROTON_ZLUDA=1`. The complete integration is still work-in-progress and as such this feature is available in the `proton-cachyos-native` package from CachyOS repositories only. The reason is that it requires some very storage-heavy dependencies to build, such as `rocm-llvm` and `hip-runtime-amd` and we don't want to force them on the AUR package. Adding support for it in the Steam Linux Runtime package is also unfinished due to these dependencies. The required `hip-runtime-amd` dependency for this feature to work is optional and will have to be installed manually. It is important to note that for ZLUDA to work properly, you also have to install the latest version of PhysX through `winetricks` and potentially remove any older PhysX dlls shipped with the applications. This integration has been tested with **FluidMark** and **Mirror's Edge** only so far. Please report any issues with this feature in https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/issues/238.\n   - To complicate matters, with the recent updates to Steam and the Steam client using SteamRT3, the native build of Proton-CachyOS doesn't work with Steam presently. If it is going to work again in the future is uncertain at this point. It is a known limitation but it still works with `umu-launcher`.\n* Wine (Standalone)\n   - None\n\nBrought to you by The Berries, [🍌](https://github.com/BananaWorks07) [🍈](https://github.com/NelloKudo) [🍋](https://github.com/loathingKernel), and their seasonal friends.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> I know that we have a lot of different packages that might cause confusion. My suggestion is to be conservative and use `x86_64`.\n> Feel free to experiment and see which fits better for your system, of course.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> * For Wayland specific flags and options, please refer to: https://github.com/Etaash-mathamsetty/Proton/blob/em-10/docs/EM-ADDITIONS.md\n> * For FSR4 related documentation, please refer to: https://github.com/Etaash-mathamsetty/Proton/blob/em-10/docs/FSR4.md\n> * For `dxvk-sarek` specific options to tune its behavior refer to: https://github.com/pythonlover02/DXVK-Sarek?tab=readme-ov-file#shader-compilation\n> * For `dxvk-low-latency` related options to tune its behavior refer to: https://github.com/netborg-afps/dxvk-low-latency?tab=readme-ov-file#dxvk-low-latency\n> * For `vkd3d-low-latency` related options to tune its behavior refer to: https://github.com/netborg-afps/vkd3d-low-latency?tab=readme-ov-file#vkd3d-low-latency\n\n**Base:** https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton/tree/experimental-11.0-20261014","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/releases/416114462/reactions","total_count":77,"+1":26,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":8,"confused":0,"heart":25,"rocket":13,"eyes":5},"mentions_count":4},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/releases/403217640","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/releases/403217640/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/releases/403217640/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/CachyOS/proton-cachyos/releases/tag/cachyos-11.0-20261005-slr","id":403217640,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOLheAvM4YCJzo","tag_name":"cachyos-11.0-20261005-slr","target_commitish":"cachyos_main","name":"Version 11.